IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-EAGLE2-SPECULATION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LOOKAHEAD-STEPS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-EAGLE2.
    IF SEQ-LEN == 0 OR HIDDEN-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 4 TO LOOKAHEAD-STEPS.
    MOVE 31 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 LOOKAHEAD-STEPS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
